</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZBUTTON2</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000054" resname="HZMOVE"><source xml:space="preserve">MOVE FORWARD BY PRESSING FORWARD KEY
MOVE BACKWARD BY PRESSING BACKWARD KEY
MOVE LEFT BY PRESSING MOVELEFT
MOVE RIGHT BY PRESSING MOVERIGHT
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZMOVE</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000055" resname="HZJUMP"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS FORWARD KEY TO RUN FORWARD
PRESS JUMP KEY TO JUMP
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZJUMP</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000056" resname="HZDUCK"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS FORWARD KEY TO RUN FORWARD
PRESS DUCK KEY TO DUCK
PRESS FORWARD + DUCK KEYS TOGETHER 
TO MOVE IN STEALTH MODE
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZDUCK</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000057" resname="HZCOMBO"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS FORWARD KEY TO RUN FORWARD
PRESS JUMP KEY TO JUMP
PRESS DUCK KEY TO DUCK
PRESS JUMP KEY TO JUMP
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZCOMBO</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000058" resname="HZDUCKJUMP"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS FORWARD + JUMP TOGETHER,
THEN THE DUCK KEY
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZDUCKJUMP</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000059" resname="HZLADDER"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS FORWARD KEY TO MOVE UP LADDERS
PRESS BACKWARD KEY TO MOVE DOWN LADDERS
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZLADDER</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000060" resname="HZLJUMP"><source xml:space="preserve">WHILE MOVING FORWARD,
HOLD DOWN DUCK KEY--
THEN PRESS JUMP
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZLJUMP</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000061" resname="HZLMOD"><source xml:space="preserve">BE SURE YOU PICKED UP THE LONG-JUMP MODULE
AT THE BEGINNING OF THE OBSTACLE
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZLMOD</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000062" resname="HZMEDKIT"><source xml:space="preserve">USE MED-KITS BY HOLDING DOWN THE USE KEY
HOLD DOWN USE KEY UNTIL HEALTH IS
AT 100 OR KIT IS DEPLETED
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZMEDKIT</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000063" resname="HZMOMENT"><source xml:space="preserve">ACTIVATE WHEELS AND DIALS 
BY HOLDING DOWN THE USE KEY
HOLD USE KEY UNTIL BRIDGE IS IN POSITION
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZMOMENT</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000064" resname="HZPUSH"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS FORWARD KEY TO MOVE AGAINST BOX
KEEP PRESSING FORWARD TO PUSH BOX
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZPUSH</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000065" resname="HZPULL"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS USE + BACKWARD KEYS TOGETHER
TO PULL BOX BACKWARD
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZPULL</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000066" resname="HZCROWBAR"><source xml:space="preserve">MOVE UP TO CROWBAR
PRESS ATTACK1 KEY TO BREAK OBJECTS
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZCROWBAR</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000067" resname="HZLITEON"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS FLASHLIGHT KEY 
TO TURN FLASHLIGHT ON
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZLITEON</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000068" resname="HZLITEOFF"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS FLASHLIGHT KEY AGAIN 
TO TURN FLASHLIGHT OFF
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZLITEOFF</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000069" resname="HZWEAPON"><source xml:space="preserve">MOVE UP TO WEAPON TO PICK IT UP
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZWEAPON</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000070" resname="HZFIREWEAP"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS ATTACK1 KEY FOR PRIMARY ATTACK
PRESS ATTACK2 KEY FOR ALTERNATE ATTACK
PRESS RELOAD KEY TO RELOAD AT WILL
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZFIREWEAP</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000071" resname="HZARMOR"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS AND HOLD YOUR USE KEY
HOLD DOWN UNTIL SUIT ARMOR IS CHARGED
OR CHARGER IS DEPLETED
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZARMOR</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000072" resname="HZSWIM"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS YOUR FORWARD KEY
AIM WITH THE MOUSE AS YOU SWIM
FIND AIR IF YOU BEGIN TO LOSE HEALTH
WAIT IN THE AIR UNTIL HEALTH 
RETURNS TO FORMER LEVEL
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZSWIM</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000073" resname="HZDAMAGE"><source xml:space="preserve">CERTAIN TYPES OF DAMAGE WILL REGISTER 
ON YOUR HEADS-UP DISPLAY.
DIRECTION OF DAMAGE IS INDICATED BY RED 
FLASHES IN THE CENTER OF YOUR SCREEN
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZDAMAGE</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000074" resname="HZHAZARD"><source xml:space="preserve">RADIATION HAZARDS 
ACTIVATE A GEIGER COUNTER
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZHAZARD</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000075" resname="HZSCIENTIST"><source xml:space="preserve">APPROACH SCIENTIST
PRESS USE KEY TO RECEIVE HEALTH FROM SCIENTIST
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZSCIENTIST</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000076" resname="HZBARNEY"><source xml:space="preserve">APPROACH SCIENTIST
PRESS YOUR USE KEY TO GET HIS HELP
WALK TOWARD DOOR AND SCIENTIST
WILL ACTIVATE THE RETINAL SCANNER
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZBARNEY</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000077" resname="HZTRAIN"><source xml:space="preserve">PRESS USE KEY TO ENGAGE TRAIN
PRESS FORWARD KEY TO ACCELERATE
PRESS BACKWARD KEY TO DECELERATE
PRESS USE KEY AGAIN TO DISENGAGE
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZTRAIN</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000078" resname="HZDONE"><source xml:space="preserve">CONGRATULATIONS!
YOU HAVE COMPLETED 
THE BLACK MESA HAZARD COURSE.
COME BACK ANY TIME.
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZDONE</note></trans-unit><trans-unit id="s000079" resname="HZWEAPONSTRIP"><source xml:space="preserve">ENTERING CIVILIAN AREA
REMOVING WEAPONS NOW
</source><note>GoldSrc identifier: HZWEAPONSTRIP</note></trans-unit></body></file></xliff>